<section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-inner">
        <div class="about-image">
            <img src="/_MG_0802.jpg" alt="Zane Devlin" class="portrait" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                Zane Devlin, a multi-faceted filmmaker based in Brooklyn, New York has been described as
                "lowkey genius" and his work as "raw." Zane seamlessly intertwines various art forms with
                a profound sense of passion and innovation. He consistently challenges perceived limitations,
                proving naysayers wrong with every artistic endeavor and having fun while doing it.
            </p>
            <p class="relocating-note">Currently relocating to Pittsburgh.</p>
            <div class="about-contact">
                <p class="contact-label">Contact</p>
                <p>
                    Feel free to reach out if you have any questions, comments, or collaboration ideas.<br />
                    <a href="mailto:zaneydevlin@gmail.com">zaneydevlin@gmail.com</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

